# Only track PUBLIC dashboard files (public-deploy branch)
*
!index.html
!data.json
!newlogo.jpg
!README.md
!.gitignore
# Self-hosted Source Serif 4 (SIL OFL 1.1). index.html references these by
# relative path — without them the dashboard silently falls back to Georgia.
!fonts/
!fonts/*.woff2
!fonts/LICENSE.txt
# admin.html and csv_to_dashboard_json.py are intentionally NOT on this branch —
# they live on `main` and must never be published to the public Pages site.
# SP Plan-SurveyExport.csv is intentionally NOT allowlisted — it contains
# respondent PII (names, emails, IPs). Keep it out of the repo.
